                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I proudly voted in favor the MilCon-VA appropriations package to ensure our service members are properly equipped and cared for. \n\nThis package fully funds veterans\u2019 health care, benefits, and critical VA programs, including funding for my top priority in Congress, the ACES Act, which passed the House and Senate earlier this year.\n\nOur nation\u2019s heroes serve with unparalleled bravery and selflessness to protect our freedoms, and they deserve nothing but the best in return.",
