                "text": "Tragic news from Fort Steward base in Georgia. I\u2019m thankful for the swift action of the first responders and medical personnel on base, and that the lockdown has officially been lifted because of their efforts.  \n\nJoin me in praying for the soldiers wounded in this horrific act.",
