                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Spot on, @JamesBlairUSA.\n\nIf Democrats refuse to work with us to address the health care affordability and access crisis exacerbated by Obamacare, then we have a duty to do it on our own through another reconciliation bill. The @RepublicanStudy Committee is ready to join the President in that fight.",
