                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On National Rural Health Day, we recognize the incredible doctors, nurses, EMS, and health care professionals who provide quality care to our communities. \n\nI am proud to stand with rural health care providers and ensure they have the necessary resources to keep citizens in Texas-11 healthy and strong.",
